# Build context for the Dockerfile (spec 08 section 6).
# Everything is left out, then only what the build needs is let back in
# (Round 2 Q4: nothing that is not needed at run time).
*

!requirements.txt
!ingestion/
!query/
!web/
!data/
!.github/scripts/active_kb_version.py
!deploy/check_pins.py
!deploy/check_manifest.py

# Never in the image, even if a rule above is widened later
# (spec 08 section 6 names the first six).
.env
.env.*
.venv/
.git/
handoffs/
evals/
notes/
indexes/
tests/
specs/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
